5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi. Let's have a fun game!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hi, I'm Daisuke. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am Asuka. I prefer logic over small talk. Let us focus on finding the werewolf efficiently.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us all stay calm and kind to one another.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello, I’m Midori. I’m a bit shy, but I’m happy to be here. Let’s all work together to find the truth!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I love the positive energy here! Let's keep chatting and get to know each other better before we start hunting.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Yumi. Getting to know each other is important. I’m still a little quiet, but I’m listening carefully to everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Small talk is inefficient. We have limited turns. I suggest we establish a voting strategy immediately to maximize our chances of survival.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Asuka: Small talk is inefficient. We have limited turns. I suggest we establish a voting strategy immediately to maximize our chances of survival.""}]}"
