15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Asuka that we need a plan, but let's stay friendly! Who feels most suspicious so far?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don't have strong feelings yet. I'm just trying to observe everyone carefully. I'm sorry if I seem too quiet.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Daisuke, your silence is suspicious. Why hide? I need data, not apologies. Who are you actually watching?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
