19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Daisuke is just being careful. Let’s not be too harsh. We should all stay calm and observe together.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I think Asuka is being a bit too harsh! Daisuke is just nervous. Let's stay positive and keep talking!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m sorry for the misunderstanding. I’m just trying to be careful. I’ll keep listening and observing everyone closely.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
